msgid ""
"PNG, JPG, GIF, WebP, or SVG. Default plugin icon is used when none is "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"PNG, JPG, GIF, WebP of SVG. Standaard plugin pictogram wordt gebruikt "
"wanneer er geen is geselecteerd."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:253
