msgstr "Neem dit mee met de betaling zodat we weten dat het van jou is."

#: templates/emails/plain/xdwp-payment-details.php:39
#: templates/emails/xdwp-payment-details.php:58
msgid "Pay before"
msgstr "Betalen vóór"

#: templates/emails/plain/xdwp-payment-details.php:41
msgid "Payment page (QR code):"
msgstr "Betaalpagina (QR-code):"

#: templates/emails/plain/xdwp-payment-details.php:42
#: templates/emails/xdwp-payment-details.php:68
msgid ""
"Only send on the network shown. Your order is confirmed automatically once "
"the payment arrives."
msgstr ""
"Alleen verzenden op het getoonde netwerk. Uw bestelling wordt automatisch "
"bevestigd zodra de betaling aankomt."

#. translators: %s: order number
#: templates/emails/plain/xdwp-payment-reminder.php:21
#: templates/emails/xdwp-payment-reminder.php:30
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Your order #%s is still waiting for payment, and the payment window closes "
"soon. If you have already sent it, you can ignore this email — the order "
"updates as soon as the transfer arrives."
msgstr ""
"Uw bestelling #%s wacht nog op betaling en het betaalvenster sluit "
"binnenkort. Als u het al hebt verzonden, kunt u deze e-mail negeren ."

#: templates/emails/xdwp-payment-details.php:65
msgid "Open payment page (QR code)"
msgstr "Open betaalpagina (QR-code)"

#: templates/payment.php:37
msgid "Payment confirmed. Thank you!"
msgstr "Betaling bevestigd. Dank je!"

#: templates/payment.php:39
msgid ""
"The payment window closed before the full amount arrived. We have received "
"part of your payment — please contact us and we will complete or refund your"
" order. Do not send more."
msgstr ""
"De betaling venster gesloten voordat het volledige bedrag aankwam. Wij "
"hebben een deel van uw betaling ontvangen Neem contact met ons op en wij "
"zullen uw bestelling invullen of terugbetalen. Stuur niet meer."

#: templates/payment.php:42
msgid ""
"The payment window closed, so the amount shown is out of date. You can get a"
" new amount at today's rate — your order is kept."
msgstr ""
"Het betaalvenster is gesloten, dus het getoonde bedrag is verouderd. U kunt "
"een nieuw bedrag te krijgen op het tarief van vandaag uw bestelling wordt "
"gehouden."

#: templates/payment.php:44
msgid "Get a new amount"
msgstr "Krijg een nieuw bedrag"

#: templates/payment.php:48
msgid "Payment window expired. Please place a new order."
msgstr "Betalingsvenster verlopen. Plaats alstublieft een nieuwe bestelling."

#. translators: 1: amount received, 2: symbol, 3: full amount due, 4:
#. remaining amount
#: templates/payment.php:57
#, php-format
msgid ""
"We received %1$s %2$s of %3$s %2$s. Please send the remaining %4$s %2$s to "
"the same address to complete your order."
msgstr ""
"We ontvingen %1$s %2$s van %3$s %2$s. Stuur de resterende %4$s %2$s naar "
"hetzelfde adres om uw bestelling te voltooien."

#. translators: 1: coin symbol, 2: network name as wallets and exchanges write
#. it
#: templates/payment.php:73
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Send %1$s on %2$s only. Sending on any other network will lose the money — "
"it cannot be recovered."
msgstr ""
"Stuur %1$s alleen op %2$s. Verzenden op een ander netwerk zal het geld "
"verliezen en het kan niet worden teruggevorderd."

#: templates/payment.php:83
msgid "Send exactly the amount below. Network fees are paid on top, by you."
msgstr ""
"Stuur precies het bedrag hieronder. Netwerkkosten worden betaald bovenop, "
"door u."

#. translators: 1: number of confirmations, 2: e.g. "usually about 20 minutes"
#: templates/payment.php:90
#, php-format
msgid "Your order confirms after %1$d network confirmation — %2$s."
msgid_plural "Your order confirms after %1$d network confirmations — %2$s."
msgstr[0] "Uw bestelling bevestigt na bevestiging van %1$d netwerk %2$s."
msgstr[1] ""
"Uw bestelling bevestigt na bevestigingen van %1$d netwerk met %2$s."

#: templates/payment.php:96
msgid "Your order confirms once the network has confirmed the payment."
msgstr ""
"Uw bestelling bevestigt zodra het netwerk de betaling heeft bevestigd."

#: templates/payment.php:100
msgid "You can close this page — we will email you when it is confirmed."
msgstr "U kunt deze pagina sluiten ."

